# Only build metadata and application source may enter the build context.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!deploy/
!deploy/Dockerfile.generator
!src/
!src/**
# Exclude accidental local artifacts even inside application source.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/.aws
**/.claude
**/credentials*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.git
**/.venv
**/data
**/*.tf
**/*.tfstate*
